{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53446","headline":"月桂 · 李正封","name":"月桂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"片月转洪蒙，扶疎万古同。\n根非生下土，叶不坠西风。\n每向圆时足，还随缺处空。\n影令羣木外，香满一轮[中]（木）。\n未种丹霄日，应虚白兔宫。\n何时得羽化，细得问元宫。\n（见《古今合璧事类备要前集》卷一）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李正封","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53446.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53446","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}